agnetic-phone-tripod-stand","icon":"5-stars"}},"testimonial_33tAjm":{"type":"testimonial","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/3_d7291d3f-aeb6-4289-9a12-ae72b2ac37fa.jpg","text":"","author":"Sophia Morgan","bio":"“Honestly? It’s one of those things I didn’t know I needed. Now I use it every single day — especially when I’m watching Netflix in bed.”","product":"portable-magnetic-phone-tripod-stand-for-iphone-black","icon":"5-stars"}},"testimonial_dDRMwy":{"type":"testimonial","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/20250412-162357.jpg","text":"","author":"Ava Brooks","bio":"“It’s the little things — like being able to prop my phone up anywhere without worrying it’ll fall. And it actually matches my phone case!”","product":"magnetic-phone-tripod-stand","icon":"5-stars"}},"testimonial_RgfDDw":{"type":"testimonial","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/1_b62936dc-80db-467c-b4e6-ed4f1401fe02.jpg","text":"","author":"Grace Collins","bio":"“I’m not big on gadgets, but this one surprised me. It’s pretty, feels well-made, and just works. No need to keep adjusting or struggling with angles.”","product":"magnetic-phone-tripod-stand","icon":"5-stars"}}},"block_order":["testimonial_dhi3Xf","testimonial_D7Mq7i","testimonial_33tAjm","testimonial_dDRMwy","testimonial_RgfDDw"],"settings":{"color_scheme":"scheme-9","heading":"Over 2,000 Happy reviews","heading_size":"h2","heading_highlight_style":"none","subheading":"","description":"","text_size":"text-base","card_color_scheme":"","card_layout":"1","columns_desktop":4,"column_gap":"medium","enable_slider":true,"columns_mobile":"1","swipe_on_mobile":true,"padding_top":100,"padding_bottom":100,"show_section_divider":false,"divider_width":"fixed"}},"rich_text_rwwcRF":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"heading_FLd9Vi":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Description","heading_size":"hd1","heading_highlight_style":"none"}},"text_V4Q8Ld":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<h2><strong>Upgrade your content with the Lumipia MagSafe Phone Stand ProMax – the smallest and most portable phone tripod we've ever designed!<\/strong><\/h2><p>Perfect for creators on the go, this foldable magnetic phone stand combines MagSafe technology with an ultra-light, foldable design, making it the ideal tool for vloggers to capture amazing content anywhere.<br\/>Key Features:<br\/><strong>Ultra-Light, Ultra-Compact<\/strong><br\/>Weighing just 92g and folding down to a sleek 99 x 59 x 16.3mm, the Lumipia MagSafe desk phone stand is smaller and lighter than most smartphones. It fits effortlessly into your pocket, wallet, or bag, so you can capture vlogs or live streams anytime, anywhere.<br\/><strong>Strong Magnetic Grip<\/strong><br\/>The upgraded 8N magnetic power securely holds your iPhone, ensuring stable shots even while moving. It’s compatible with iPhone 12-16 series, MagSafe-compatible cases, or magnetic accessories, offering a reliable grip for smooth content creation.<br\/><strong>Stable & Durable <br\/><\/strong>Crafted from premium aluminum alloy, this foldable phone tripod can support up to 1kg in weight. Its sturdy build ensures reliable, stable support whether you're filming outdoors or shooting at your desk, combining durability with portability.<br\/><strong>Versatile 4-in-1 Functionality<\/strong><br\/>Transform the phone stand in just seconds into a desktop stand, vlog handle, video stabilizer, or mini tripod. Switch easily between portrait and landscape modes to suit all your shooting needs.<br\/><strong>Why Creators Love the ProMax:<\/strong><br\/>The Lumipia MagSafe Phone Stand ProMax is the most compact, lightweight MagSafe phone tripod available. From café vlogs to mountain hikes, it’s easy to carry and shoots effortlessly in even the tightest spaces thanks to its ultra-compact design.<br\/>Upgrade to the MagSafe phone stand that goes wherever you do—without weighing you down.<\/p>","text_size":"text-base"}}},"block_order":["heading_FLd9Vi","text_V4Q8Ld"],"settings":{"color_sc